* gameport.device's base function (Exec900; the NDK's gameport.device has
* none), in the C900 dialect of exec_lib.fd.  It takes GamePortBase as its
* first argument.  GetGPButtons returns the IEQUALIFIER_ button bits held
* now.
##base _GamePortBase
##bias 42
##public
GetGPButtons()() ULONG @gpbuttons
##end
